<title>USA: Watsco names Barry Logan CFO.</title>
<headline>Watsco names Barry Logan CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI, Fla. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watsco Inc said Friday it named Barry  Logan chief financial officer and vice president of finance.</p>
<p>The company said Logan will keep his position as treasurer.</p>
<p>He replaces Ronald Newman, who is retiring.</p>
